  "dataNotes": [
    "Cooldown values are the base cooldown listed by the source. Legends: Z-A cooldown can be modified by the Pokémon's Speed and certain status/effects; no final cooldown calculator is included in this data foundation.",
    "Distances are stored as reported game-distance values. Do not label them near/far or infer hitbox geometry without further verification.",
    "Wind-up and attack-loop values are raw frame values as reported by the source. Conversion to seconds depends on the game's frame rate and needs to be implemented consistently before user-facing calculations.",
    "Do not recommend a move solely because it exists in this catalog. The owning Pokémon's ZA learnset or the user's recorded moveset must be checked.",
    "The community move index flags incomplete coverage for the Mega Dimension version 2.0.0 update. DLC-specific moves/forms must be individually verified before adding.",
    "The starter species slice records species and types only; it does not imply a complete form list or learnset."
  ],
